<p>Fire a steady shot, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">135%, 150%, 161%, 171%, 180%</acronym> damage with a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">22%, 24%, 26%, 28%, 30%</acronym> chance to mark the target.</p><p>If Steady Shot is not on cooldown, this talent will automatically replace your normal attacks (and trigger the cooldown).</p>